      }
    ],
    "disposition": "Mailbox address/value custody remains in Core action; program_types owns original declaration lookup; Native action and VM resources own their real execution capabilities; existing snapshot and rollback owners retain session state. Compiler/RuntimePlan only project the same evaluated-effect algebra, and Source/wire codecs preserve it. No dependency or I/O boundary changed. Existing large dispatcher/snapshot/semantic owners keep their cohesive closed dispatch responsibilities, with no new schema authority, source reconstruction or public API widening for physical splitting."
  },
